      "title": "Change how the packet dedup structures are handled during a live capture",
      "message": "Change how the packet dedup structures are handled during a live capture\n\nInitialize the data structures as the capture starts, not when\nthe window object is constructed.\n\nWhile reading the packets, use the frame cksum pointer as the\nflag for whether to use the data structures or no. During a live\ncapture, the user can change the preference, so we can't rely\non the preference flag after we start the capture.\n\nFree the memory when cf_finish_tail() finishes after the capture is\nfinished.\n",
